.Dd August 23, 2026
.Dt DWL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dwl
.Nd dwm for Wayland
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl s Ar startup command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a Wayland compositor based on wlroots, filling the same niche as
.Nm dwm
does for X11.
This build includes the
.Em bar ,
.Em gaps
and
.Em vanitygaps
patches: it draws its own status bar and gaps, no external bar needed.
.Pp
.Fl v :
print version and exit.
.Fl d :
enable full wlroots debug logging.
.Fl s Ar cmd :
run
.Ar cmd
as a session/autostart command (killed with SIGTERM on exit).
Unrelated to the status bar, which
.Nm
reads from its own stdin
.Pq Sx STATUS INFORMATION .
.Pp
Customize by editing
.Pa config.h .
Default bindings:
.Bl -tag -width 20n -offset indent -compact
.It Mod-Return
Spawn
.Xr foot 1 .
.It Mod-q
Spawn
.Xr qutebrowser 1 .
.It Mod-Shift-v
VPN toggle script.
.It Mod-s / Mod-Ctrl-s
Screenshot: full / area.
.It Mod-Ctrl-l / r / Ctrl-h / Ctrl-w
Terminal apps: lf / rmpc / htop / wiremix.
.It Mod-d
Wmenu app launcher (also usable as a calculator).
.It Mod-v
Wmenu clipboard manager
.Pq Xr cliphist 1 .
.It Mod-Shift-l / Mod-Shift-h
Next / previous wallpaper.
.It Mod-Ctrl-p
Power mode
.It Mod-Escape
Lock the screen.
.It Mod-p
Pick a color
.Pq Xr hyprpicker 1
and copy it to the clipboard.
.It Mod-F5 / Mod-F6
Brightness down / up.
.It Mod-F1 / Mod-F2 / Mod-F3 / Mod-F4
Audio mute / volume down / volume up / microphone mute.
.It Mod-[jk]
Focus down/up.
.It Mod-Shift-[IP]
Master area window count.
.It Mod-[hl]
Master area size.
.It Mod-Space
Cycle layout.
.It Mod-Shift-Space
Toggle floating.
.It Mod-e
Toggle fullscreen.
.It Mod-u
Toggle gaps.
.It Mod-Shift-b
Toggle bar.
.It Mod-Shift-Return
Zoom window to master.
.It Mod-Ctrl-c
Close window.
.It Mod-0 / Mod-Shift-0
Show/tag all.
.It Mod-,/.
Focus prev/next monitor.
.It Mod-Shift-,/.
Move window to prev/next monitor.
.It Mod-[1-9]
View tag.
.It Mod-Ctrl-[1-9]
Add tag to view.
.It Mod-Shift-[1-9]
Move window to tag.
.It Mod-Ctrl-Shift-[1-9]
Toggle tag on window.
.It Mod-Shift-q
Quit.
.It Ctrl-Alt-Backspace
Quit (Terminate_Server).
.It Ctrl-Alt-F[1-12]
Switch VT.
.El
Defaults from
.Pa config.def.h ;
check
.Pa config.h
for what's actually built.
.Ss Mouse
.Bl -tag -width 20n -offset indent -compact
.It Mod-Button1/3
Move/resize window (drag).
.It Mod-Button2
Toggle floating.
.It Button2 on bar title
Zoom window.
.It Button2 on bar status
Spawn
.Xr foot 1 .
.It Button1/3 on bar tag
View/toggle tag.
.It Mod-Button1/3 on bar tag
Tag/toggle-tag window.
.El
.Sh STATUS INFORMATION
.Nm
does not print to stdout for an external bar; it reads status text
.Em from
its own stdin for its built-in bar, one line at a time.
.Pp
A line may hold multiple
.Sq \&|Ns -separated
segments plus ANSI SGR color codes
.Pq Sy \e033[ Ns Ar n Ns Sy m :
.Bl -tag -width 6n -offset indent -compact
.It 0 / 1
Reset / bold.
.It 4 / 24
Underline on/off.
.It 7 / 27
Inverse on/off.
.It 30-37 / 40-47
Fg/bg color, indexes
.Ar barcolors[0-7]
in
.Pa config.h .
.El
.Pp
Feed it like:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
slstatus -s | dwl
.Ed
.Pp
(the
.Fl s
startup command above is separate and unrelated to this.)
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width XDG_RUNTIME_DIR -compact
.It Ev XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
Wayland socket location.
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_DIR
Config search path (incl. libxkbcommon).
.It Ev DISPLAY , WAYLAND_DISPLAY , WAYLAND_SOCKET
Server connection.
.It Ev WLR_*
wlroots settings.
.It Ev XKB_* , XLOCALEDIR , XCOMPOSEFILE
libxkbcommon settings.
.It Ev XCURSOR_PATH
XCursor theme search path.
.El
Set by
.Nm :
.Ev WAYLAND_DISPLAY
and, with Xwayland,
.Ev DISPLAY .
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
slstatus -s | dwl -s 's6-svscan <&-'
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dwm 1 ,
.Xr slstatus 1 ,
.Xr foot 1 ,
.Xr xkeyboard-config 7
.Sh BUGS
All of them.
